# The setup app at setup.assistant-ui.com. It hosts the browser side of
# `npx assistant-ui setup`: the agent opens https://setup.assistant-ui.com/#link=…
# and the page joins the agent on the setup worker.

# The setup worker (apps/checkout-worker). Defaults to
# https://checkout.assistant-ui.com, or the local `wrangler dev` server on
# http://localhost:8791 in development.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_CHECKOUT_URL=

# The docs site, for the product catalog, install guides, sign-in and
# Assistant Cloud projects. Defaults to https://www.assistant-ui.com, or
# http://localhost:3000 in development.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_DOCS_URL=

# Optional. PostHog project key; analytics stay off without it.
# NEXT_PUBLIC_POSTHOG_API_KEY=
